OL,3,GNEWSAThe night Sid Vicious asked me:
OL,4,A'Do you want a fight?'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA professor has spoken of the night Sid
OL,7,FVicious challenged him to a fight at a
OL,8,FSex Pistols gig, as the 50th
OL,9,Fanniversary of the punk band's first
OL,10,Fsingle approaches.
OL,12,FProf George McKay, of the University of
OL,13,FEast Anglia (UEA), saw the band in
OL,14,FDecember 1977 at the Links Pavilion in
OL,15,FCromer, Norfolk, when he was 16 years
OL,16,Fold.
OL,18,FHe told BBC Politics East how the punk
OL,19,Fmovement had influenced his political
OL,20,Fviews.
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
